	Well, there's more than one way to skin a cat.  You could hang
	out and play the mastermind game in front of the castle, or
	you could force the door open some other way.  My favorite way
	from 3.0j was to zap the door with a spell or wand of opening,
	but I haven't found many (any) of those in 3.1.  You could
	also zap it with a wand of striking or a spell of force bolt,
	but you would have to find another way to cross the moat (try
	that wand of cold again.)  You *will* need levitation, water
	walking, water breathing, or some such on the way back.  Don't
	open the door behind the throne unless you have one of those.

